{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805070/extras/65d98113088ac24787d4cf5979f964a4.poster.avif?t=1770323510\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805070/extras/65d98113088ac24787d4cf5979f964a4.webm?t=1770323510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805070/extras/65d98113088ac24787d4cf5979f964a4.mp4?t=1770323510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Enter the unique world of Screenbound, where your Quantum boy (Qboy)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >transports you into a weird dual dimensional space that occupies 5D = 3d + 2d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Screenbound is a platformer unlike any other. You move in first person view at the same time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >while playing in 2d on the screen of your Qboy. Mind bending environmental puzzles will force you </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to test the limits of dimensional space. Your jumping and movements are mirrored - but certain things affect </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the opposite dimension. <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and explore many hidden areas and weird ideas will be all around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805070/extras/d679aabdef7df35f7663b149f19eb324.poster.avif?t=1770323510\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805070/extras/d679aabdef7df35f7663b149f19eb324.webm?t=1770323510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805070/extras/d679aabdef7df35f7663b149f19eb324.mp4?t=1770323510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>So how the heck did this happen? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mom invented the device and you found it in the garage. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She was keeping it secret all this time, and other dark secrets start to come out as you delve deeper. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll find other stuff too. But let's not spoil the plot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2805070?t=1770323510","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805070/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770323510","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805070/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770323510","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805070/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770323510","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805070/extras/65d98113088ac24787d4cf5979f964a4.poster.avif?t=1770323510\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805070/extras/65d98113088ac24787d4cf5979f964a4.webm?t=1770323510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805070/extras/65d98113088ac24787d4cf5979f964a4.mp4?t=1770323510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Enter the unique world of Screenbound, where your Quantum boy (Qboy)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >transports you into a weird dual dimensional space that occupies 5D = 3d + 2d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Screenbound is a platformer unlike any other. You move in first person view at the same time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >while playing in 2d on the screen of your Qboy. Mind bending environmental puzzles will force you </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to test the limits of dimensional space. Your jumping and movements are mirrored - but certain things affect </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the opposite dimension. <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and explore many hidden areas and weird ideas will be all around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805070/extras/d679aabdef7df35f7663b149f19eb324.poster.avif?t=1770323510\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805070/extras/d679aabdef7df35f7663b149f19eb324.webm?t=1770323510\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805070/extras/d679aabdef7df35f7663b149f19eb324.mp4?t=1770323510\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>So how the heck did this happen? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mom invented the device and you found it in the garage. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She was keeping it secret all this time, and other dark secrets start to come out as you delve deeper. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll find other stuff too. But let's not spoil the plot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Crescent Moon Games","Those Dang Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805070/header.jpg?t=1770323510","is_free":false,"legal_n